  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WB Vattenresurser  och bevattning (VoB)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WB Water Resources and Irrigation Project (WRIP) - WB Water Resources and Irrigation (WRI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) establish the strategic framework to manage water resources at the national level and at thelevel of the Drin-Buna and Semani River basins and (ii) improving, in a sustainable manner, the performance of Selected Irrigation Systems.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xF6;reslagna projektet kommer att best&#xE5; av komponenter som          behandlar 1) Reneovering av bevattningsystem 2) Institutionellt och   produktivt st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r bevattning och dr&#xE4;nering 3) Institutionellt st&#xF6;d  till f&#xF6;r integrerad vattenf&#xF6;rvaltning och 4) Genomf&#xF6;rande st&#xF6;d.       Genomf&#xF6;rande-parters kommer att vara Jordbruksministeriet och         Milj&#xF6;ministeriet. Sverige st&#xF6;djer fra komp 3, dvs EU:s Vattendirektiv</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will comprise components dealing with 1)         Irrigation systems rehabilitation 2) Institutional and productive     support for irrigation and drainage 3) Institutional support to for   Integrated Water Resources Management and 4) Implementation support.  Implementation partners will be Min of Agriculture and Min of         Environment. Sweden to support Component 3 which relates to EU WFD</narrative>
  </description>
